WEBVTT

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.400
We can't do it here...

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.210
Then how about back home after you get off work?

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.260
We're going to do it again?

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:18.800
You don't want to?

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:24.540
We're just practicing again, right?

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.320
Yeah.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.900
Then I guess I have to...

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:50.460
I wonder if he's sleeping.

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:33.760
It'll be cloudy later in the day today, with a 30% chance of rain.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.850
I want some hot lemonade too!

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:39.780
How about I show you how to make it next time?

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:43.570
Jeez, just listen to you! This is why I don't like girls with boyfriends.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:44.840
What do you mean?

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:48.730
Uzuki-chan always says she wants to teach me stuff, too.

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:51.550
If it bugs you so much, why don't you try getting a boyfriend yourself?

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:55.050
You've changed!

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:31.020
I told you it'd be bad if someone sees us.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.450
There's no one here.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:33.960
That's true, but...

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.300
We'll be late.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.460
But...

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.200
I'm sure Katsura-san will be waiting for you today.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:17.490
Its the same flavor of lemonade my mother used to make for my father when they were dating.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:26.420
My mother kept saying things like, "I guess you're all grown up" and...

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:34.770
You can still make it! Hand-crafted Christmas presents, special this month.

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:39.570
You can still make it! The Christmas presen-

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:46.190
Hey, look at this. Staying at the Sakakino Hills Hotel is 40,000 yen a night.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:48.610
That's expensive!

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:51.430
Why don't you take me there?

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.100
Sorry, that's not possible.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.520
Don't take me so seriously, silly.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.250
Morning!

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.890
Good morning! Why do you look so tired?

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:20.250
It's been a while since I've made breakfast for two. I'm tired.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:21.930
Dummy!

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.680
Why?

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.630
Is there something on my face?

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.910
No.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.400
Th-That's good.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.510
See you.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.610
Sekai, you were with Itou this morning?

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.920
I thought that was the case.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:42.230
That means Itou broke up with Katsura-san in Class 4, right?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.160
Y-Yeah...

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.430
That's good, then.

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:53.750
Keikichi was happy to have to come to such a lively place.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:06:00.610
When he came out of the alley, he saw the shops with their food smells packed tightly together.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.190
The record shop was playing...

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.860
Let's tell Katsura-san about us.

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:12.250
Why?!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:23.140
If we keep doing this...

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.000
Wait!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.170
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?!

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:34.150
It's not practice anymore.

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.890
Well, that's...

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:39.490
It's not fair to Katsura-san if we keep this up.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.380
Kotonoha's going to get mad.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.030
Of course she will!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.060
I'll feel really guilty...

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:51.730
...if we don't tell her soon.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.200
Here you go. It'll warm you up.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:05.890
Um, thanks.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:07.960
Thanks for the drink.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:20.870
Is something the matter?

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.870
No, not really.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:25.300
Do you not like it?

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.390
That's not-

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.690
I'm sorry!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:31.400
My mother told me that it was perfect when it's this sweet!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.420
No, that's...

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:35.890
I'll practice more so that I can make it how you like it.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:39.200
It's okay! This is really good!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:43.610
It was so good, Makoto was just so surprised he couldn't say anything, right?

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:45.800
Y-Yeah.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:46.970
Really?

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:51.960
Yeah, I think this is how sweet it should be and it really does warm you up.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:52.830
Yeah.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:53.890
Yeah...

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:55.700
That's good.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:08:04.030
My mother told me I could get any guy with this. It's her secret hot lemonade.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:07.410
R-Really?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.530
World History

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:12.050
Next is Xun Zi...

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:22.680
Xun Zi lived in the third century, and he held the opposite philosophy of Mencius, whom we discussed earlier.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:21.860
1 Item
From: Katsura Kotonoha
Would you like to go shopping with me after school today?

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:27.370
This philosophy is called Xing E, the theory of innate evil, which holds that mankind is born evil...

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:32.370
1 Item
From: Itou Makoto
Sorry, my little sister is supposed to come over today.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:48.580
Sekai, can I go over to your place today?

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.670
B-But you just told Katsura-san...

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.980
Oh, I lied.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:58.620
Well, it is true that my sister lives with my dad, and that she comes over from time to time.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:01.730
You lied to Katsura-san again...

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:02.990
Well, that's...

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:06.340
You didn't tell her about us either...

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:09.010
Well, I'll tell her eventually!

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:13.250
Just...it'd be bad right now.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.250
Don't you agree, Sekai?

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:17.000
That...

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:21.200
...might be true, but...

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.940
So, it's okay.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:28.510
That couldn't be them, right?

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:54.390
We're good. It looks like Setsuna's gone now.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.210
Let's go.

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.130
1 Item
From: Itou Makoto
Sorry, I overslept. Go on without me.

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:21.730
Itou?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.080
Morning.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.230
Morning.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.520
Let's go.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:31.940
The bell is going to ring.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.450
Wh-What is it, Minami?

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:54.290
I'm already here.

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:57.170
Who cares? We'll just do it in the classroom.

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:03.600
Great...

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.860
Now, in regards to what each class is going to do for the culture festival,

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:34.970
please discuss it in first period homeroom tomorrow.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:37.360
I hope that all of your proposals are in accordance with...

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:40.360
...our overall theme for the fair this year, "Sincerity and Good Faith."

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.880
What's going on today?

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.120
0 Items
Where are you?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:52.110
1 Item
From: Katsura Kotonoha
Subject: Where are you?
Looks like we're going to finish up early today. Want to go home together?

00:12:54.370 --> 00:13:00.300
1 Item
From: Katsura Kotonoha
Subject: Where are you?
Looks like we're going to finish up early today. Want to go home together?

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:02.860
I guess I should head home.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.280
Sekai!

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:09.990
You're dating Katsura-san.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.840
I guess that's...true...

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:17.810
So you should go home with her.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:19.780
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:09.990
What is it?

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.500
Don't you think this would be nice?

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:17.520
Super Discount Campaign!
Buy two and get a couples discount!
Low monthly rates, too!

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:22.420
Wouldn't it be nice to get a matching pair of the latest models?

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:25.240
But...

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:36.350
I'd get them as a present!

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:41.420
I want to have the same cell phone as you!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:49.680
It's okay. I'd feel bad if you got me something like that.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.670
Let's go.

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:07.780
Are you okay?

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.300
Sorry...

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.290
It's not something to apologize for.

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:18.300
So you knit?

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.110
Um...

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.900
I just started learning.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:29.090
It's going to get colder, and I thought it'd be nice if I could knit something before Christmas...

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:32.150
Like a scarf, or a sweater.

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.650
Maybe something we could wear together.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.660
Sekai?

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.890
Are you asleep?

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.800
Do you not feel well?

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.400
No, I don't.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:56.800
Then I'll go home for now.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:57.680
Okay.

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:00.430
Feel better.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:11.930
1 Item
From: Itou Makoto
I like you more.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:45.200
Octopus and Rice: 8, Hyottoko-Yaki: 4, Coffee Shop: 16, Haunted House: 1, Sell Professor Mathers's Research: 1, Love Advice Corner: 1, Little Sister Café
Menu - Tea, Coffee, Cola, Orange Juice, Apple Pie, Cream Puffs, Blueberry Pie, Kuroda-san's Pie, Various Combos, Other
Waitress uniforms must be a cute color. Everyone is to bring their own shoes.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.180
Any other ideas?

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.190
Yes!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:51.190
All of the female customers will have me as their escort!

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:52.190
Rejected.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:55.190
I'll give all of them my phone number!

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:56.190
Rejected.

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:58.400
And we can include a hot kiss in there as a combo item.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:16:59.410
Rejected.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.570
Why?!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.100
Ideas for the School Fair
Haunted House

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:34.100
So you'd invite him like this.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:35.680
The girl would?!

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:40.190
And if he takes your hands, that means you can tell him you like him!

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:46.240
So, Otome, go for it!

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:47.720
Y-Yeah.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:51.750
Tell us who you're going after already.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.320
I don't wanna.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.630
At least give us a hint.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:58.890
I want a hint!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.670
A hint wouldn't hurt, would it?

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.010
A hint!

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.160
We went to the same middle school...

00:18:09.840 --> 00:18:13.470
So that means you've liked him this whole time?

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.970
Y-Yeah.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:17.240
I wonder who it is.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.960
You went to Harami Middle School, right?

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:22.280
That's right...

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:25.920
There aren't many guys here who went there.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:26.830
What?

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.140
No...

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:30.210
What's wrong?

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:33.820
It just kind of looked like Ms. Planning Board Member over there was looking at us this whole time.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.810
What is it, Katsura? Have a problem?

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:41.250
No. Just that it's homeroom, so we should be having a discussion...

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.610
We're not the only ones talking.

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:45.180
Why don't you say that to everyone?

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.300
I'm sorry.

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.850
What is this girl apologizing for?

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:50.310
I'm sorry...

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:53.570
Now I don't feel like doing anything.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:56.270
She's only getting mad at us.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:57.850
That's not what I meant!

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:02.240
Besides, doing a haunted house isn't really that popular anymore.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:03.950
Why don't you do it yourself?

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.160
I couldn't do that...

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:09.620
But it doesn't really look like anyone wants to help.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:14.980
I already don't want someone who goes around trying to pick up guys to be in charge of this.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.710
Trying to pick up guys...

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:20.370
You kept following around Itou in Class 4 yesterday, didn't you?

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:21.460
That's...

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:26.790
You're bugging Itou. You should stop doing things like that.

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:29.880
Huh? Didn't Itou go to Harami Middle School?

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:33.950
Then, does that mean he's the one Otome likes?!

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:33.950
Is...

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.890
Is that true?

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:42.660
Do you like Makoto-kun?

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.740
That's none of your busine-

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.990
It is!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:49.890
Because I'm his girlfriend!

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:53.240
He asked me out and I'm dating him now.

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:56.370
I wasn't trying to pick him up or trying to nag him.

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:57.370
That's a lie.

00:19:57.370 --> 00:19:59.890
I'm not lying. It's all true!

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.550
Otome...

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:08.840
Nothing's going to come from you trying to attack me just because you like Makoto-kun.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.770
Is the School Fair Panel Member here?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.820
Y-Yeah!

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:19.700
During lunch, come to the usual room and give your report. We'll discuss our agenda there.

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:21.750
Okay. Got it.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:29.090
1 Item
From: Katou Otome
Do you know Katsura from my class? She said she's dating Itou. Is that true?

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:41.100
1 Item
From: Katsura Kotonoha
Subject: Sorry
I have some things I have to do during lunch for the planning board.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.870
Entry of Forwarding Address
Saionji Sekai

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:48.110
Forwarding...

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:52.110
1 Item
From: Kanroji Nanami
I heard that Katsura's been saying that, but I haven't heard it personally. Something happen?

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:02.220
2 Items
To: Kanroji Nanami
Could I ask you for help with something really quick?

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:04.960
1 Item
From: Katsura Kotonoha
Subject: Sorry
I have some things I have to do during lunch for the planning board.

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:46.170
I said no.

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:49.160
It'll be quick. That's fine, right?

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:49.900
But...

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:52.120
I won't let you go.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:56.610
I'll be leaving!

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:01.430
More...

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:04.240
I said no...

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:07.120
Oh, that'll be fine.

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:08.310
Okay!

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:14.380
Makoto-kun!

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:15.900
Makoto-kun!

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:19.380
Makoto, I love you!

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:20.810
Yeah.

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:24.900
Even if you're dating someone else,

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:26.090
I still love you!

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:45.610
Sekai, I love you.

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:47.890
I love you, too.

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:04.030
No way!

00:24:47.570 --> 00:24:54.010
Next time
The Night Before The Fair
